// Set these to your own before running the CloudKit stages. The local stages run without them.
//
// SYNCLAB_TEAM: your Apple developer team ID, as shown in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities.
// SYNCLAB_BUNDLE_ID: a bundle identifier your team owns.
// SYNCLAB_CLOUDKIT_CONTAINER: a CloudKit container your team owns, starting with "iCloud.". Use one only for
// testing: the lab writes and deletes test items there.

SYNCLAB_TEAM =
SYNCLAB_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.SyncLab
SYNCLAB_CLOUDKIT_CONTAINER = iCloud.com.example.SyncLab
